        "heading": "One percent, compounded.",
        "text": "<p>Skincare doesn’t need to be complicated. It needs to be understood.</p><p><strong>Original 1%</strong> was built around a simple idea: meaningful change comes from small, intentional steps practiced consistently. Rather than asking your skin to do everything at once, we focus on five essential areas of care: hydration, softening, toning, nourishment, and moisturization.</p><p>Understand what your skin needs. Choose the right step. Use it consistently. Then build from there.</p><p>It’s our approach to skincare and to progress itself: 1% better every day.</p><p>Our formulas are purposefully designed and made in a certified Canadian facility, with clean ingredients, then presented in Italian glass chosen to make everyday skincare feel considered, functional, and worth keeping within reach.</p><p>Original 1%®</p><p>1% more you, every day™.</p>",
